config BR2_PACKAGE_SRT
	bool "srt"
	depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
	help
	  open source video transport protocol that enables 
	  the delivery of high-quality and secure, low-latency 
	  video across the public Internet. 

	  https://github.com/Haivision/srt

comment "SRT needs a toolchain with thread support"
	depends on !BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
